<title>GERMANY: MAN sees upward trend continuing in 96/97.</title>
<headline>MAN sees upward trend continuing in 96/97.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>German truck manufacturer and engineering group MAN AG said it expected a continued upward trend in its profits and good earnings for its 1996/97 business year.</p>
<p>The Munich-based group, whose business year ends June 30, said sales and incoming orders both rose during the first quarter of the year.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
